Hi! WGLC ends on Wednesday.  I know this I-D is not all that exciting =
and most of the =E2=80=9Cdiscussion" was about whether to adopt the I-D =
at all, but it would be great if we had a couple of more people chime =
in.  If you remember, when we used the show of hands tool to help =
determine whether there was consensus to adopt this draft there were 36 =
who wanted it adopted.

spt

