>> This email starts the working group last call for "Legacy =
RSASSA-PKCS1-v1_5 codepoints for TLS 1.3=E2=80=9D I-D, located here:
>>=20
>> https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-tls-tls13-pkcs1/
>>=20
>> The WG Last Call will end 5 June 2024 @ 2359 UTC.
>>=20
>> Please review the I-D and submit issues and pull requests via the =
GitHub repository that can be found at:
>>=20
